=== Visitors ===
Accepting visitors on the [[Garden]] grants {{skl|Farming|XP}}.
{{Skl|Farming|XP}} is determined with this formula: <math>FarmingXP = BaseItems \times ItemFarmingXP \times VisitorRarityMultiplier</math>{{Confirm}} (<math>BaseItems</math> is from the [[#Requests|Requests]] formula)<br>
<math>VisitorRarityMultiplier</math> is determined by the '''Visitor's''' Rarity:
* {{Rarity|u|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×0.05}}
* {{Rarity|r|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×0.06}}
* {{Rarity|l|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×0.75}}<!--
* {{Rarity|s|nolink=y}}: {{Green|×0.75}}-->

=== Farming XP Boosts ===
{{Main|Farming Wisdom}}
Players can increase their farming XP gained by increasing {{stat|farming_wisdom}}, which can be increased by:
* [[Booster Cookie]]: {{stat|farming_wisdom|25}}
* Drinking {{Potion|Farming XP Boost}} potions: {{stat|farming_wisdom|5–20}}.
** [[God Potion]]s include the {{Potion|Farming XP Boost III}} effect, and has significantly higher duration.
* [[Rabbit Pet]]: When at {{lvl|100}}, the {{Rare}} Rabbit Pet grants {{stat|Farming Wisdom|25}} while the {{Epic}}, {{Legendary}}, and {{Mythic}} variants grant {{stat|Farming Wisdom|30}}.
* Farming Tools give {{stat|FmW|1–3}}. They can also be upgraded with the {{ref|Blessed}} reforge and the {{ench|Cultivating}} Enchantment. A maxed Farming tool can grant {{stat|FmW|18}}, which can be increased by {{Green|5%}} if the tool is an Axe, via the [[Forest Essence Shop]].
* The {{ID|Dragonfly Shard}}'s {{Attr|Garden Wisdom}} attribute grants {{stat|FmW|0.5–5}}, which can be increased {{Green|20%}} with the {{attr|Echo of Wisdom}}, which can be upgraded by {{Green|50%}} with {{attr|Echo of Echoes}} to a total of {{stat|FmW|6.5}}.
* The [[Fruit Bowl]] consumable can be used to gain {{stat|FmW|1}}.
* The [[Not Very Moldy Bread]] and [[Very Moldy Bread]] consumables can be used to gain up to [[Farming Wisdom|+30 ☯ Farming Wisdom for 60m]], consuming '''[[Very Moldy Bread]]''' grants a permanent +1 [[Farming Wisdom|☯ Farming Wisdom]]. The permanent buff can only be gained 5 times.
